ki-uid-box\">df2034f4-d9a4-484a-8b9f-507bc26c7868</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:df2034f4-d9a4-484a-8b9f-507bc26c7868\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:df2034f4-d9a4-484a-8b9f-507bc26c7868\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oliver_Tefoco\" title=\"Oliver Tefoco\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Oliver_Tefoco.png/25px-Portrait_Oliver_Tefoco.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Oliver_Tefoco.png/38px-Portrait_Oliver_Tefoco.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Oliver_Tefoco.png/50px-Portrait_Oliver_Tefoco.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Oliver Tefoco\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3b/Portrait_Oliver_Tefoco.png/25px-Portrait_Oliver_Tefoco.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3b/Portrait_Oliver_Tefoco.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Oliver_Tefoco\" title=\"Oliver Tefoco\">Oliver Tefoco</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>Oliver Tefoco, The Bee Hive-\n</p><p><br>\nWe regret to inform you that we cannot send the contents of a safe deposit box to a client's home, as it is bank policy that clients collect such contents personally. The Counting House cannot be liable for street shipment of valuables. Please visit us at our office where we can securely serve all your financial needs.\n</p><p><br>\n- Regards, Clerk Zollerix, The Counting House\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202850\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.053 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.056 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1857/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 31661/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 8040/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 930641/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.558      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   44.558      1 -total\n 55.33%   24.655      8 Template:Icon_text\n 48.94%   21.808     19 Template:Trim\n 21.30%    9.490      2 Template:Uid\n 15.58%    6.942      3 Template:Icon_link\n 14.77%    6.583      1 Template:Main_only\n 12.12%    5.400      2 Template:Template_style\n 10.26%    4.571      8 Template:Ifempty\n 10.22%    4.553      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:34884-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202850 and revision id 365534. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}